{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUCLEAR BOMBS! GHOSTS! FUTURISTIC MACHINES! And of course... PIZZA!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver all kinds of crazy packages in <strong>Birbox</strong>, a 2D puzzle-platformer where you play as a regular bird with a very irregular job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every package is a new delivery experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Birbox Inc.</strong>, deliveries are... let\u2019s say <i>extravagant</i>. That\u2019s why each level introduces a new mechanic to master \u2014 from umbrellas to teksaballs!<br>Wait\u2026 you don\u2019t know what a teksaball is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think outside the box... and with the box itself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These deliveries won\u2019t be easy. You\u2019ll need to use <strong>physics</strong> and the <strong>unique properties</strong> of each package to solve <strong>puzzles</strong> that require timing, skill, and the cleverness of a crow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with the competition \u2014 literally!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, did we mention the deadly robots? Between puzzles, you\u2019ll face <strong>enemies</strong> that spice up your delivery routes.<br>You\u2019ll also encounter <i><strong>bosses</strong></i> who want to stop those boxes from reaching their destination.<br>They\u2019re not just tough \u2014 they\u2019re puzzles too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Too easy for you? Go for five stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our clients demand <i>speed</i>. So if you\u2019re up for a challenge, try to complete each delivery <strong>as quickly as possible</strong> to earn a five-star rating.<br>(Who knows \u2014 it might come in handy later\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you'd prefer a more careful approach? Try finishing levels <strong>without damaging the package</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for perfection or take it easy \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chat with unforgettable clients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this bird-filled world, every customer is unique. Before each delivery, you'll have a chance to <strong>talk with your clients</strong> \u2014 no matter how big, old\u2026 or clueless they might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Birbox \u2014 for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the only delivery job where you\u2019ll handle rockets, radioactive materials, and... a <i>ton</i> of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002780?t=1757583648","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/4faf7fc45f6a2e2237ae09e402c0f7763b4596f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757583648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/84c844cdc2832b16c51dd214f25c2cf113279514/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757583648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/84c844cdc2832b16c51dd214f25c2cf113279514/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757583648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUCLEAR BOMBS! GHOSTS! FUTURISTIC MACHINES! And of course... PIZZA!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver all kinds of crazy packages in <strong>Birbox</strong>, a 2D puzzle-platformer where you play as a regular bird with a very irregular job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every package is a new delivery experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Birbox Inc.</strong>, deliveries are... let\u2019s say <i>extravagant</i>. That\u2019s why each level introduces a new mechanic to master \u2014 from umbrellas to teksaballs!<br>Wait\u2026 you don\u2019t know what a teksaball is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think outside the box... and with the box itself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These deliveries won\u2019t be easy. You\u2019ll need to use <strong>physics</strong> and the <strong>unique properties</strong> of each package to solve <strong>puzzles</strong> that require timing, skill, and the cleverness of a crow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with the competition \u2014 literally!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, did we mention the deadly robots? Between puzzles, you\u2019ll face <strong>enemies</strong> that spice up your delivery routes.<br>You\u2019ll also encounter <i><strong>bosses</strong></i> who want to stop those boxes from reaching their destination.<br>They\u2019re not just tough \u2014 they\u2019re puzzles too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Too easy for you? Go for five stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our clients demand <i>speed</i>. So if you\u2019re up for a challenge, try to complete each delivery <strong>as quickly as possible</strong> to earn a five-star rating.<br>(Who knows \u2014 it might come in handy later\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you'd prefer a more careful approach? Try finishing levels <strong>without damaging the package</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for perfection or take it easy \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chat with unforgettable clients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this bird-filled world, every customer is unique. Before each delivery, you'll have a chance to <strong>talk with your clients</strong> \u2014 no matter how big, old\u2026 or clueless they might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Birbox \u2014 for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the only delivery job where you\u2019ll handle rockets, radioactive materials, and... a <i>ton</i> of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.poster.avif?t=1757583648\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.webm?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.mp4?t=1757583648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["PumoGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"